 ### Added
 
+- Totem API (BFF for the Flutter totem) in [`docs/api/totem.md`](docs/api/totem.md): pairing login (`POST api/totem/auth`) with HS256 JWT, `GET api/{entity}/queues`, `GET api/{entity}/{queue}/priorities` and `POST api/{entity}/{queue}/ticket` (issuance through `IssueTicket`, channel `totem`). Authenticated calls go through the `totem.auth` middleware, which re-checks the totem, preset and entity per request. Throttled (10/min pairing, 30/min tickets); CORS for localhost/127.0.0.1 and `TOTEM_WEB_ORIGIN`.
+- `totems`, `totem_presets` and `totem_preset_queue` tables, models and factories. `php artisan totem:pairing-code {preset}` opens a 10-minute pairing window with the preset's own 6-digit code. Config: `TOTEM_JWT_SECRET`, `TOTEM_JWT_TTL`, `TOTEM_WEB_ORIGIN`.
